{
  "version": "0.9.13",
  "notes": "Add Skyrim SE modding diagnostics for uploaded Vortex plugin/loadorder exports and recognised crash logs, with bounded summaries, line evidence and cautious diagnosis guidance. Add explicit PC vision-model setup and optional image / timestamped sampled-video-frame analysis through the private worker; originals and audio stay on the browser device. Keep vision separate from normal text routing, cache successful observations, disclose offline/unsupported/omitted evidence and preserve chats, memories and fallback. Validate parsers, real HTTP guards and real Chromium media/menu flows; no live PC inference accuracy or speed is claimed.",
